FFmpeg master b8daf520dd03 (2026-10-24), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2;
CVE-2026-125185:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/b8daf520dd03f6139aa053acb768f3c4594599d9

HEVC: AFGS1 film grain parameters (in T.35 SEI messages) with scaling points of
a repeated x value made generate_scaling() divide by zero: ffmpeg crashes
(SIGFPE) on a crafted upload. Such points are now refused, as the AV1
specification requires.

